    <mxCell id="vn_tl" value="&lt;div style='width:262px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;white-space:normal;'&gt;&lt;div style='margin-bottom:4px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start;'&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;background:#DC2626;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:10.2px;font-weight:900;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;'&gt;PAIRWISE TRAP 1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;background:#FEE2E2;color:#991B1B;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;'&gt;Missing OBO Auth&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:15.5px;font-weight:800;color:#0F172A;line-height:1.18;'&gt;Code + LLM Without User Scope&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:12px;color:#334155;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.32;'&gt;Fast tool execution running on a shared service key — 1 prompt injection leaks cross-tenant rows.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:19px;font-weight:900;color:#DC2626;margin-top:4px;line-height:1.05;'&gt;Security Veto at Review&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="34" y="214" width="266" height="122" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="vn_tr" value="&lt;div style='width:262px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;white-space:normal;'&gt;&lt;div style='margin-bottom:4px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start;'&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;background:#EA580C;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:10.2px;font-weight:900;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;'&gt;PAIRWISE TRAP 2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;background:#FFEDD5;color:#9A3412;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;'&gt;Missing Typed Code&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:15.5px;font-weight:800;color:#0F172A;line-height:1.18;'&gt;LLM + Auth Without State/CFG&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:12px;color:#334155;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.32;'&gt;Asking an LLM to enforce math, JSON schemas &amp;amp; retries in prose — collapses on multi-step edge cases.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:19px;font-weight:900;color:#EA580C;margin-top:4px;line-height:1.05;'&gt;64% Multi-Step Drift&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="620" y="214" width="266" height="122" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="vn_bl" value="&lt;div style='width:400px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;white-space:normal;'&gt;&lt;div style='margin-bottom:4px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start;'&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;background:#059669;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:10.2px;font-weight:900;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;'&gt;★ CENTER SWEET SPOT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;background:#D1FAE5;color:#065F46;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;'&gt;Ikigai of Agent Design&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:15.5px;font-weight:800;color:#0F172A;line-height:1.18;'&gt;Use LLMs Only for Ambiguity; Code for Invariants&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:12px;color:#334155;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.32;'&gt;Let Gemini parse intent &amp;amp; synthesize evidence while deterministic code owns schemas, money math &amp;amp; IAM.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:19px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;margin-top:4px;line-height:1.05;'&gt;99.3% Prod Reliability&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="38" y="794" width="404" height="124" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="vn_br" value="&lt;div style='width:400px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;white-space:normal;'&gt;&lt;div style='margin-bottom:4px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start;'&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;background:#0F172A;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:10.2px;font-weight:900;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;'&gt;MNEMONIC: V · E · N · N&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;background:#FEF3C7;color:#92400E;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;'&gt;IG + LinkedIn Share Hit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:15.5px;font-weight:800;color:#0F172A;line-height:1.18;'&gt;Validate CFG • Enforce OBO • Narrow LLM Role • Audit Node&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:12px;color:#334155;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.32;'&gt;In every design review, ask which of the 3 circles is missing before writing a single prompt.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:19px;font-weight:900;color:#2563EB;margin-top:4px;line-height:1.05;'&gt;Zero-Fluff Architecture Test&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="478" y="794" width="404" height="124" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

